## Explicit rules

- **`{{SCOUT}}` runs alone first** for any multi-layer request — nothing else is
  dispatched in the same turn, since its report shapes what the implement agents
  are told to build.
- **`{{DOMAIN_AGENT}}` runs alone, before every other builder**, whenever the
  scout lists a rule, a new type or a new error kind. Its receipt fixes the
  domain names the next agents use. If a later builder reports `blocked` because
  a rule or type is missing, re-dispatch `{{DOMAIN_AGENT}}`. Never let the
  blocked builder write it.
